          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Tightened sanctions that curb Iranian exports and/or constrain banking flows can push up global energy and risk premia and inflation expectations, raising long-term nominal sovereign yields via higher term premia and expected inflation." />
