          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Rising fiscal financing pressure pushes governments to protect domestic industry and revenue streams through tariffs, quotas or conditional subsidies, increasing the intensity of trade barriers affecting bilateral commerce." />
