          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A sustained rise in diesel prices feeds directly into headline and near-term inflation expectations and term premia, prompting markets to demand higher compensation on long-dated sovereign bonds." />
